#: scenario3:scenario3_F74B4BC4_D8C5_4733_9ABF_35269E2F4E1B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8f7946783bda45aad505b372ffdf7e0ddc2bbd9db305e9d42c964a7c177a973c
#. default-sha256: 92b6f7e49a25caca4c4f773319c2f35eb4fa830dd8b966ba1ffa03124852f8ba
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F74B4BC4_D8C5_4733_9ABF_35269E2F4E1B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫As I am sure "
"you’re aware,⟪k:15⟫our parents arranged our marriage."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫마리아도 알다시피,"
"⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫저희가 결혼한 건 부모님들끼리 정한 거예요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E3921769_2D38_4C09_BE2B_C3FAB8954F5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 01141e3b359b1482cd9588f501b5943c503f8fa210beb5b4ee6abe713ac555ee
#. default-sha256: 4d8f10d3a9983f28af73e2f3304167142a57c2e4a0b6b02950d231b8a20db5a4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E3921769_2D38_4C09_BE2B_C3FAB8954F5F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Before I emigrated to this country to be married,⟪k:1⟫I lived in a misty island nation."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫저는 결혼하고 ⟪k:1⟫이주하여 이 나라 사람이 되기 전에는⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫안개가 잦은 섬나라에서 살았어"
"요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DAC7B3C0_732D_409E_89FB_BA5DA7F7AA85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66c1ec81ec004ae54d72d5b56707869516b7a32b680007702a6c5c91a1de2954
#. default-sha256: 902e85cdb883184baad80a732031ed7ad7378e940e8e9b92591b501e4cfc7e8c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DAC7B3C0_732D_409E_89FB_BA5DA7F7AA85"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Portraits of my ancestors hung in the house where I lived; ⟪k:1⟫I remember as a child "
"wincing in fear at the sight of them staring down at me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫집에는 조상님들의 초상화가 있었는데, ⟪k:1⟫어린 시절에 ⟪k:2⟫그 초상화의 눈에 주눅들곤 했어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DBE1D544_437A_4EA1_A4AE_72415CC8A542
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cfe16ce037bf7345ba9f2290eb1cb84301d50108c4eee78d4b2852f226c25935
#. default-sha256: 8aca2967efe4f49f0427a893ced61022ffb9ab8f9ed2d48edb85c1c9440d7000
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DBE1D544_437A_4EA1_A4AE_72415CC8A542"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My mother and father were constantly telling me to show them respect, as it was their hard "
"work that kept our bloodline alive and well."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫아버님과 어머님께선 ⟪k:1⟫저 분들이 우리의 혈통을 지켜 주셨으니 ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫예의를 깍듯이 갖추라"
"고 매번 잔소리를 하셨는데……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9DD4ED73_16F9_4FFC_9EFC_98614F6F2EE1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e5fb3a172bfbdad583cc63dd149612668698f7886ba6261e1bca2597c8d40649
#. default-sha256: f45512c25b21ce86d24e4f957da86c8fc3b69fa421bc1ab4d5316beb7417d7b4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9DD4ED73_16F9_4FFC_9EFC_98614F6F2EE1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫However, they were fighting an uphill battle to do the same."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫두 분 모두 ⟪k:1⟫필사적이셨을 ⟪k:2⟫거예요…….⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫그 집안을 지키려고요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_072A1B06_90A2_4577_BCBE_5C088CD6E1A4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 98ab2be95c283c0cba690350f48c03387e3309d49300f08ed91392015847cda3
#. default-sha256: cdee1c7fd859fbf77cbf6d3ddb8791533a33e863fbbce760cd88a94eead31b7b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_072A1B06_90A2_4577_BCBE_5C088CD6E1A4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It would have been clear to anyone reasonably perceptive that our house was coming tumbling "
"down."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫감이 좋은 사람이라면 ⟪k:2⟫저희 집안이 몰락 중이란 걸 ⟪k:3⟫모를 리가 없었죠."

#: scenario3:scenario3_933D312C_E93D_4CEC_AA55_C9D4130C9584
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f11a8927f58b80bee5439fe8cae5201c3c2c863a814667022a4b7d988be95569
#. default-sha256: 7fb1bc8494469ba2629326fbc819885bf137278f4017b80416f4c2d43f19290b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_933D312C_E93D_4CEC_AA55_C9D4130C9584"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Valuable furniture and paintings slowly disappeared, and eventually, the portraits were gone "
"too."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫귀중한 장식품과 그림이 점점 줄었고, ⟪k:1⟫끝내는 조상님들 그림까지 사라졌어요. "

#: scenario3:scenario3_276FA1EE_7BE7_42FE_B7B8_38F135004E9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 00f0f89013d0416128f09fba676ccbf82a0860e7cf82a2352242df318a3081f2
#. default-sha256: 6d2a227152fa5c3923aef33b25d28772632be1180a9b1c6f168e1e54c5731f3d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_276FA1EE_7BE7_42FE_B7B8_38F135004E9B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As our house collapsed, so too did my parents’ health deteriorate, robbing us of any source "
"of income."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫집안이 점점 몰락하자, ⟪k:1⟫아버님과 어머님도 잔병치레가 끊이질 않아서 ⟪k:2⟫돈을 벌 방법도 없"
"었고……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_370DA7F7_699A_42D9_A365_056EF3436F72
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d4ac31cabeb046c36782d065590aaac7b084525900b1c84dcf293f4d8dfd1436
#. default-sha256: 4c511e6d0ec10a5fb5d0ef732d20fb9c79a404e2ccf05785459476eec5bc12ae
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_370DA7F7_699A_42D9_A365_056EF3436F72"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And though I was educated, I lacked the skills necessary to obtain work."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저는 교양은 있지만, ⟪k:1⟫그게 일자리를 주진 않았죠."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D3D7A52A_B8DB_4C19_BA09_60E282AE0634
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8a6621236aff91c69cff45b6dba2604991634e159bebc2fbb1f9ae7f2fa0a82
#. default-sha256: a04d1105fc5ba02ac7b79192ea8bd2f3fd933d947a479833eefb2c5f233dd6a3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D3D7A52A_B8DB_4C19_BA09_60E282AE0634"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Just as we were about to run out of money and options, my parents received Jacopo’s parents’ "
"marriage proposition."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫저희는 길거리에 나앉기 직전에 놓였어요.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……혼담이 온 건 ⟪k:3⟫마침 그럴 때였어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D3F0987D_A17D_4E12_8D2D_F1D04AA0CB79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c7bba58428e9c8b9ab582bd3fcfb53f895de9534834c5d740bd00f6174664062
#. default-sha256: 5f67df9abe7888307158d7399c7710277bc4372271bf6ad1443471d43ccb21aa
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D3F0987D_A17D_4E12_8D2D_F1D04AA0CB79"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Both of our families stood to benefit from the arrangement.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I had social status, "
"and he had wealth."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫서로의 이해가 일치했을 거예요.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫저에게는 명가라는 사회적 입장이 있고, ⟪k:3⟫그 분에게"
"는 자산이 있었어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_101759FA_890B_4EFB_81BB_B46CB0E7B3E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 26099c4dd7be5da8e99f3dda597ea479a22ed5f93291d25574e6076f457f06f3
#. default-sha256: 11b8451caa650c5d06bb06d48279ad4c269ee3c97843f434d3c81d0cec161854
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_101759FA_890B_4EFB_81BB_B46CB0E7B3E4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫We each had what the other lacked."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫뒤집어 말하면 ⟪k:1⟫서로 그 점이 부족했죠."

#: scenario3:scenario3_FDFCE645_52E3_4461_A4EA_211D5297E6B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 23c9f7cf6eebaaca928d6b03afb24acfb650c80f503c1cb28620d53e98818cb0
#. default-sha256: 955dec6a8a1572e6b0cf26c87c64a0e0308b7bb241e484b8c1c5b1386cf02819
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FDFCE645_52E3_4461_A4EA_211D5297E6B4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫One needs more than money to make it in the world.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Without at least a semi-"
"reputable name attached to you,⟪k:3⟫you’re liable to get laughed out of most social gatherings."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫능수능란한 세상살이를 위해선 ⟪k:1⟫돈만 가지곤 부족해요. ⟪k:2⟫사교계에서 얕보이지 않을 만큼, "
"⟪k:3⟫집안에도 가치가 있어야 하죠."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3F9E8416_8158_49CE_B53C_3ABD9A69FB6A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc8294e0fd2173f7e47b46a3db99ff27a05a2148659cdd4cf8f8ce261284fc82
#. default-sha256: 9c097a269da94c90531fa5241fb4a263d49db21dcabb9bf988faf5b9f703d7fe
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3F9E8416_8158_49CE_B53C_3ABD9A69FB6A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I first met Jacopo here, in this country.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We didn’t even know what the other looked "
"like until our wedding day."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그래서…… ⟪k:1⟫저와 그 분이 처음 만난 것도 ⟪k:2⟫이 나라였어요.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫결혼할 때까지 ⟪k:5⟫서"
"로 얼굴도 못 봤거든요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EC6CE469_9E0E_4596_B092_7CE515148639
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13b236d1cff34e50c4b39c7622f2b4fd5a73e7f9f8374c39125151751d335aef
#. default-sha256: d5b6dfdb2f35fa22e38493ef755477726d1494ffd76a022e78c582b54178c6c6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EC6CE469_9E0E_4596_B092_7CE515148639"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫To be quite honest, I was scared to death at first.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I was so nervous. What kind of "
"man would he be?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Was I to be wed to some middle-aged stranger?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫솔직히 말해서…… 당시에는 무섭기만 했어요. ⟪k:1⟫긴장했죠. ⟪k:2⟫어떤 분일까, ⟪k:3⟫혹시 아버님뻘"
"이진 않을지…… 걱정도 했어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_57B4CD43_0996_4BFA_93C0_65EA9CA4E18A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1e02762d38cf648eb147156f0769854dbc67eb062158b370da40026d915111b8
#. default-sha256: db8ee6ca40090d68b4b7582ffe247110b864015fce3a051e17e5c729a0ea120e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_57B4CD43_0996_4BFA_93C0_65EA9CA4E18A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫We were not marrying because we had fallen in love like a normal couple."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저와 그 분은 ⟪k:1⟫다른 남녀처럼 연애를 거쳐 결혼한 게 아니었어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_736DA51F_F6C1_4E3A_A414_D9879E31B034
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1e51126700affe61d06da6a3239fdd6b85a884aba192bb077e3bb0185863ede3
#. default-sha256: b8379106d12421e845e55c0a257507a82721d622000d4bbafeaaa93ad6d22fb4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_736DA51F_F6C1_4E3A_A414_D9879E31B034"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I knew I was in no position to be concerned with such things,⟪k:1⟫but when I thought about "
"our future, I shook with fear."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫제 걱정이나 할 입장과 처지도 아닌데, ⟪k:1⟫앞날을 생각하니 ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫몸이 절로 떨렸어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DA9DA23A_2141_4983_AE01_EE5D3C61858A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eae08f60b96c33e104bdd2512645f6b326e2783c81ff20f7a8477a628520c3ab
#. default-sha256: 11712058f2667c8e7171daba02dec6a42ef1215e187f3a3dde4ff084d1662725
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DA9DA23A_2141_4983_AE01_EE5D3C61858A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But the man I saw through my veil at the wedding was remarkable."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫결혼식장에서 ⟪k:2⟫베일 너머로 보인 그 분은 ⟪k:3⟫멋지셨어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_41F047EC_6FF2_4718_A8B2_2212EB7E4302
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc2ffe0e91621eaa19f93fa6cf099685e07fbfd69f143f0631c83c539ce4d3ce
#. default-sha256: 84f554cde3a820e9784a0d11a90695e7e1fb9bcafe6c6b2aba32ef75d56ce9e5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_41F047EC_6FF2_4718_A8B2_2212EB7E4302"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He was young, had strong, masculine eyes,⟪k:1⟫and at the same time, he too appeared nervous."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫젊고 ⟪k:1⟫남자다운 눈, ⟪k:2⟫그런 반면 조금 긴장하신 것처럼도 보였어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_15C24639_C5DE_457E_A063_7A017E7B0AB7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 89d28ffeea81e5a6b99ca03dd81cabbd1a686313f4d9702abbea79729ad3199a
#. default-sha256: 277bf6158525aab94b967b1951b2af5b9fb638e4f73bd071463a0eecaaa60764
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_15C24639_C5DE_457E_A063_7A017E7B0AB7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hehe... ⟪k:1⟫He was shaking as much—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫no, even more than me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫후후……, ⟪k:1⟫저도 똑같이, ⟪k:2⟫아뇨, ⟪k:3⟫그보다 더 긴장하고 있었죠."

#: scenario3:scenario3_84835AAC_2787_4917_BED2_E2CF58959E44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eba7421213d4518712ae8098d323a8a56a5052001a71525731589d5b2b1b2f41
#. default-sha256: 51b071633292cccd2eeec32566de2a5f67dfbd426854fa2996552801a3be0f4a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_84835AAC_2787_4917_BED2_E2CF58959E44"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Seeing that, the priest gave an impish little smirk when he asked Jacopo if he vowed his "
"eternal love to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그걸 알아채신 건지, ⟪k:1⟫신부님께서 영원한 사랑을 맹세하겠냐 하실 때, ⟪k:2⟫그 분은 살짝 장난"
"기 있게 웃어 주셨어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_74AF65CC_87AB_4374_9A1B_21EAA1FFC794
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7212726f888378046a95265f5eae2cf2b8a2340f5ef0f26fb260b13ff24588f5
#. default-sha256: 605b0f08e454c56f3ae213788bbb2283f6ae7b6749315ef30fb77a7b1823fafb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74AF65CC_87AB_4374_9A1B_21EAA1FFC794"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I... ⟪k:1⟫counted myself among the happy. ⟪k:2⟫And I still do.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫For in that moment, "
"I experienced true love."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫저는…… ⟪k:1⟫행복한 축에 들 거예요. ⟪k:2⟫지금도 그렇게 생각해요.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫그 순간, ⟪k:5⟫저는 "
"확실하게 ⟪k:6⟫사랑에 빠졌거든요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_23632B1E_62F8_4ED5_B3D8_9FC3A4A6F783
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66cbfd9984a2a162e5529ada575fbd405cb4bb9bc0a4af5e60f1b4d54377775a
#. default-sha256: 3ee37d14f6b22d00a6a6318dfb9ffcfad9bbfe5af5b83d5385cc85dfa84a691b
