"world."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫마차 창문을 통해 ⟪k:4⟫많은 걸 보았어요.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫친정에서도 집에만 있던 제게"
"는 ⟪k:7⟫모든 게 색달랐어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F7E471AF_39FD_4DD6_BA3D_5E4AFD9F4448
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f5a572f3bc43ffc3416c1f16bb520c21b98c7c3f8bb14f6071413bbbedf23187
#. default-sha256: 299b14d7e2d6354b2053af83fe8cd3f407dfa5b58680975598d3d39cd6415175
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F7E471AF_39FD_4DD6_BA3D_5E4AFD9F4448"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And add to that the rapid industrial advancement currently taking place. I saw men shouting "
"back and forth as they smacked newspaper articles with the backs of their hands."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫지금은 안 그래도 ⟪k:1⟫산업이 발전 중이죠? ⟪k:2⟫신문을 읽고서 ⟪k:3⟫갑론을박을 펼치는 남성이 보"
"였고――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_ACA8EC42_591F_41E2_8D16_DA7FC376D6C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13754930785c29f1931b164807a72d1d2c6ddb3731ceb8aa42f76d30080407c2
#. default-sha256: 1c2e10c92f1c8decd252180fe437779bcd7ba5b1866a45bc9c72d1d104d4210b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_ACA8EC42_591F_41E2_8D16_DA7FC376D6C1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I saw corner cafés crowded with cigar-smoking men on break from work."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫길모퉁이 카페에선 ⟪k:1⟫담배 연기를 뿜으며 휴식하는 사람들도 있었어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3E770804_C359_4AD0_9005_C149A830FD99
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd8d2fbac5e594a71a0e6fb31533927065f4af7a0a643cb9f611f5a9aac24846
#. default-sha256: 17f8ed0e2b05404754ad8fd6469c686ec70b44b93932bab722615929ccef47e4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3E770804_C359_4AD0_9005_C149A830FD99"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was like the hustle and bustle of a festival."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫꼭 축제 같았죠――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_09F1954E_E863_48A3_AB29_810051BD9AC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3d9a7e8f2935969a798655c393d6df961ef5b388baa182ec34fc23f008cc432d
#. default-sha256: 2d533ca31f8052e8fbf5544576083911b1dda0a5bf0c1216f88d789a5fb182ec
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_09F1954E_E863_48A3_AB29_810051BD9AC9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But every festival has its underside.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I also saw overworked men, looking like they "
"were on the verge of collapse, drinking water from a spigot on the side of the road."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……하지만 ⟪k:1⟫축제에는 그늘도 있더라고요. ⟪k:2⟫길가 수도꼭지에서 물을 마시는 노동자의 얼굴은 "
"⟪k:3⟫피로에 절어서 ⟪k:4⟫당장이라도 쓰러질 것 같았어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_81720A2E_E9C4_42AD_8CE4_1F595F4C433A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c38ee08c03f5b3defe8868eb7d94c14eb35c06c8586f2c226624bb77da2fc737
#. default-sha256: 11ccc1c179cbf89d6a172312e930c71b24c53e203c971dd254b023967f1a3c3d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_81720A2E_E9C4_42AD_8CE4_1F595F4C433A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫By way of contrast, I wore fine clothing and had a carriage at my disposal."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그에 비해 ⟪k:1⟫저는 이렇게 좋은 옷을 입고, ⟪k:2⟫외출하는 데에도 마차를……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_26A919A1_89F1_4143_8922_218DC4FC45E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 72bf93662a7626107804f32d7eafd95666cb01dae482dc6165adab626eb7f802
#. default-sha256: 7121367f0bc204f1d1a750b4fd2892ea6ff9ffbe4943dc695e51d0a60a88e8cb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_26A919A1_89F1_4143_8922_218DC4FC45E4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I imagine every day was a struggle for them just to remain afloat."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저 사람들은 ⟪k:1⟫매일 먹고 사는 데 급급할 만큼 ⟪k:2⟫힘든 생활을 보낼 거예요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DC0B0531_15BA_4CEB_862A_21A6FAF15CBC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc51d20d5fcb61a5f93562657341fa3e7ab861737b3d89036b63740d9365962f
#. default-sha256: 747f55f56757451d4f3254214d5b2057f8ef541f5d560f97e9d2c89676bc9977
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DC0B0531_15BA_4CEB_862A_21A6FAF15CBC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Had I not married the man I had, I too might have found myself on the streets in a similar "
"situation."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫제가 ⟪k:1⟫그 분이랑 결혼하지 않았다면,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫저도 ⟪k:4⟫똑같은 처지에 놓였을 수도 있어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F4922A8A_F0C8_45C0_8543_304E7803862E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 57149aa574d2ec3a2bd86c122b7f8627727dd7e6d486c53454528b0b8a2318ac
#. default-sha256: c23ade6594eaeb25b132e9ad599072b7197a59e8a7b85aadecc4eb579990d949
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F4922A8A_F0C8_45C0_8543_304E7803862E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But it was not relief that spread through my breast at the sight of them—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫it was "
"pangs of guilt."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫제 가슴이 울컥한 건 ⟪k:1⟫안심해서가 아니라,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫죄책감 같은 게 들어서였어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_52700419_9AB1_4915_AD52_69907D07B46C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dce0f10a664f85a172235d63affeaf4a9b064cfed2e8eebdf93d3608cde4df27
#. default-sha256: 2dad0fe07f3add483260c0255300392114b7339fe3d3c218626936f5d2d91896
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_52700419_9AB1_4915_AD52_69907D07B46C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It felt to me like a life of opulence was wrong—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫sinful."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫돈이 있고 ⟪k:1⟫질 좋은 생활을 유지하는 게…… 죄를 짓는 것 같았어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_163C0426_05C8_426E_B539_128F3806B452
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d53652b025e698c0d4772a30ab29500c35576e8accd3bc898a75d85c69375bbf
#. default-sha256: 4935f9a22690540fb32f1574fa8c6f3cbe6687514ab7ac63f87091cdc66d24a3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_163C0426_05C8_426E_B539_128F3806B452"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It broke my heart to know that I was living so much better than them."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저만 좋은 생활을 한단 사실. ⟪k:1⟫그게 ⟪k:2⟫마음이 아팠어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A783A18D_AFF5_4E09_BD0A_ED9C67F7EE03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b2c8f0b7a610d3835d78059775038e6da6e41d619c5783bd94e7c13f249b889c
#. default-sha256: 63ff7bd7804360f6b075a52b1bcdde7b021ca8c04c1f9be9aaf142fa317bf65d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A783A18D_AFF5_4E09_BD0A_ED9C67F7EE03"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Jacopo snorted disapprovingly at me,⟪k:1⟫seemingly reading my mind, and then said,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그 분은 제 그런 마음을 ⟪k:1⟫눈치채신 거였을까요.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫언짢게 콧방귀를 뀌며 ⟪k:4⟫이렇게 말"
"씀하셨어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B9EF10F3_F029_4FA1_B685_919660CA249B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c035642fbe0229de2587f3e83821c3978ab041957bb1cd24d122b3ba2870b771
#. default-sha256: 902deca4a8154c6d709e696dc5ac2376d99cd62f4e58cf7d1328e31b32bdeda6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B9EF10F3_F029_4FA1_B685_919660CA249B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The poor man who envies the rich, covets his wealth, and finds the ambition to make the same "
"for himself; and the rich man who pities the poor, thinking it his duty to give them offerings of "
"philanthropy."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫가진 자를 시샘하며 ⟪k:1⟫거기에 다다르려는 야심.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫못 가진 자를 연민하며 ⟪k:4⟫적선해 주"
"려는 동정심."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DC0D11EF_97EB_4AF4_BBDF_E766FA189913
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38674cdeeaf6bd6aa0b334fe218e484df5aa47350cadff931db5518ad27c9cfd
#. default-sha256: 41e7b45c54f7ee8f76e4870518d81a089b5702e4eb119327daf90de0ec1c7130
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DC0D11EF_97EB_4AF4_BBDF_E766FA189913"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫To me, the latter is the far more nefarious.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Excessive charity will ruin a man—⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫make him come to ⟪k:5⟫expect⟪k:6⟫ handouts."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫내가 보기엔 ⟪k:1⟫후자가 더 죄질이 커 보이는데.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫과도한 적선은 인간을 타락시켜. ⟪k:4⟫"
"받아먹는 게 당연해지거든."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7580BB79_0880_4B00_B09A_5AB66A50A862
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9e4cdcf5f0d322255844aa9603dca135c72b1252e634ab9338bc8487a052fc07
#. default-sha256: 17e4db286527d62dbce1e5f6de9713a767cd171cbde2dafe25f3534730bb9096
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7580BB79_0880_4B00_B09A_5AB66A50A862"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And then there are those with the wrong idea of pity,⟪k:1⟫who let themselves fall down to "
"the same place,⟪k:2⟫mistakenly believing it will somehow make the poor feel better."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫더구나―― 연민을 잘못 품는 놈은 ⟪k:1⟫똑같은 곳까지 몰락해.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫같은 입장에 서는 게 ⟪k:4⟫"
"놈들에게 위안이 될 거라 착각하는 거지."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B458156B_E124_44F7_ADB2_465039BD8E86
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 749ce4ab7b20e6782d31fc506f59afe4f6861199c52f00e6548b9b9ed30b9c22
#. default-sha256: 5ca44ffd7695846948840b5de5eeea1c92e71518ec3f1a5788ffb315e5919223
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B458156B_E124_44F7_ADB2_465039BD8E86"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What a joke.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If you’re going to do anything for them,⟪k:3⟫you might as well "
"encourage them to climb upward.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Spur on economic growth and the flow of capital."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫우습기 짝이 없어. ⟪k:1⟫그럴 바에는 ⟪k:2⟫누구나 위를 꿈꾸는 게 나아.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫금전도 순환되"
"고, ⟪k:5⟫경제도 발전하잖아."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D6F4E7EC_444F_45AA_AADE_3440E0DC6019
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a765b953f162db60c1b9998b8804b02d2b615a2464dec201749e5b7e160c7de2
#. default-sha256: 50b2c9e71b2723e88e0d78c886c90c9f142c95b7a241626c2d0228daaf51972e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D6F4E7EC_444F_45AA_AADE_3440E0DC6019"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Doesn’t that sound like the better option?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그게 낫지 않겠어?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_6EC44BC1_4A4E_4836_B550_52ACE5E7DF2D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e124d735ad439627efc77893aab30e72c74b3adb12a3789c54a1d6c870e5b7e6
#. default-sha256: fd0decb3f95a2923d13eb62c629c6618de1b0bc9b0977db111d791646320476e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_6EC44BC1_4A4E_4836_B550_52ACE5E7DF2D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I say nothing, simply smiling and giving an ambiguous nod."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫저는 아무 대답도 못 하고 ⟪k:1⟫애매한 미소만 지으며 끄덕였어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F7805F0B_400E_4C2A_9E7E_9C63E47B4F9C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 56638d35b31786367ce4e00b30bc1c11d58a03894c790411ad6a0fc2638c3ddd
#. default-sha256: 19d31f72f8855b78b3b3f47e887b204b880e9da8cbab723821859ca9a7fca8c0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F7805F0B_400E_4C2A_9E7E_9C63E47B4F9C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had a point—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫my sympathy and guilt meant nothing to people actually experiencing "
"hardship."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그 말씀대로 ⟪k:1⟫제가 품은 죄책감과 ⟪k:2⟫동정심은……불우한 처지에 놓인 분들께 ⟪k:3⟫아무 의미"
"도 없을 거예요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_57AC9D4E_7833_4FB3_BD10_8C8973D388E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3e27b4b1f9bfaf1228e154829cbca9d88f49f27d56f014b7f1676ba99fa206de
#. default-sha256: b4056db5d1f762e8b19c58f0edf0a3df6d08c30f738ebc92d9a56302b1e51bc4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_57AC9D4E_7833_4FB3_BD10_8C8973D388E3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If, feeling guilty of my own fortune, I acted upon that pity in the way he had described, it "
"would accomplish little more than self-satisfaction."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫제 입장이 복받은 게 미안해져서 ⟪k:1⟫똑같은 짓을 하더라도 ⟪k:2⟫자기만족에 불과하죠."

#: scenario3:scenario3_0AE4D07C_52F0_49A1_AF90_1B33580AC416
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ef4a2a735d63b547b9e4eaf7c7cd4e7ad040228deb17d761b9de1a9b42c3fe4
#. default-sha256: d0317e8a92718d0679feab6bd7981bc80ea0e89a9cfaf0f98d9bad5ef3d30c79
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0AE4D07C_52F0_49A1_AF90_1B33580AC416"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He seemed to have seen straight through to my very core."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그 분은 저란 인간을 ⟪k:1⟫간파하신 걸 수도 있겠네요.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫원래부터 ⟪k:4⟫자산 운용으로 돈"
"을 버시는 분이니까요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_338A214B_4F06_4322_9C63_D42884C88DEF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ef2ebfef016d62c74e5542cbe33adc70199417cc31a31deb219b9c122d049b7a
#. default-sha256: 25088d6a64625ed9b27b6582ccd39c16287535767ba65277d2b028a153cb3225
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_338A214B_4F06_4322_9C63_D42884C88DEF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This was a man who had built his own fortune through investment, which I imagine required "
"him to be rather astute."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫빼어난 관찰안을 ⟪k:1⟫지니신 걸 거예요……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F0325961_F8F1_4CD8_AA01_5263343BCEB2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f42898051c0cc1e88eddfc13a64f9c6e6f643ec60923e04f7ca1fce411f7c09
#. default-sha256: 1e0301c89edb167c5126d9ead96090f4e32bd728dc6b3a78b91e3c52892ae7bb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F0325961_F8F1_4CD8_AA01_5263343BCEB2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But doesn’t a world where everyone is constantly trying to climb higher and higher sound "
"rather... ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫exhausting?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그래도…… ⟪k:1⟫누구나 위를 꿈꾸며 달리는 세계는 ⟪k:2⟫조금 ⟪k:3⟫피곤할 것 같지 않나요?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_2E910B1B_0FDE_4326_A041_49C2890B066B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2497090db372677f36de48af77fa55d38a20b80ec4f378a182852fa332a92d20
#. default-sha256: 641a154dbfa8d1e4dd791b98d09c0d5aaae5d1fc408176b737b2a1c6ecf9e357
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2E910B1B_0FDE_4326_A041_49C2890B066B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I, personally, would prefer to be in a position where I could watch—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫if only from a "
"distance—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫as others climbed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫저는 ⟪k:1⟫비록 멀리서라도 ⟪k:2⟫달리는 사람을 지켜보는 쪽…….⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫그런 입장이고 ⟪k:5⟫싶었"
"어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_DFC0CC61_2D5D_40C2_A766_B58A603DD386
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9867a3892b70e4bfd40d756b51461fb425a3475d3ad3847695e6caa54f94ca5d
#. default-sha256: ccbfa3d8c0870f87816a994248cecd57e19dc847bb3886ab5a000b92c8a85842
