msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Say, for example...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a moving record of the opening ceremony of the railroad.⟪k:3⟫"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫That⟪k:6⟫ would be something worth watching."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그래――, ⟪k:1⟫철도 개통식을 ⟪k:2⟫움직이는 사진으로 남기면 재밌겠는데."

#: scenario3:scenario3_616D40B5_BBA1_4502_8F57_C8EE141DD1A3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5722a12ad8fc1f9bcd27eb29edc52b4b552e01644be7c5fc4304cf497027dc8f
#. default-sha256: d1f2b32317b6c8409426512c51fbb38f33311538e0ab75808b473696671c04d7
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_616D40B5_BBA1_4502_8F57_C8EE141DD1A3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And then, in time, it would expand beyond a mere record-keeping technology and find its way "
"into the hands of artists."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그리고 장차 ⟪k:1⟫기록 기술의 틀을 넘어 예술가가 달려들겠지."

