"wicked to his core—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I swear it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫나리는요, ⟪k:1⟫퉁명스러워 보이고 ⟪k:2⟫말을 험하게 하시지만―― 마냥 썩어 빠진 분까진 아닙니다. "
"⟪k:3⟫이거 진짭니다요?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F7FFBE68_47A9_439F_AA03_4B2F1C3DE410
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 35f8f493be5e85b34564790cac068caeb46dbe37d941ac7e0ff5d31a2bd46800
#. default-sha256: 0df5576d1dc2eecff28eac34b890a6eb3ed43c01f762bf545d405aeb9dd9a45d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F7FFBE68_47A9_439F_AA03_4B2F1C3DE410"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So please, ma’am, be a pillar of support for him."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그러니 ⟪k:1⟫사모님. ⟪k:2⟫나리를 잘 챙겨 주십쇼."

#: scenario3:scenario3_98C292A7_C21E_4D5A_B22F_BBBF6202FDC5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4d5fc9bad9a8e69bc30c20db9285b08d4f6bf4c866294ff80128e9e6bc991ef1
#. default-sha256: 33072ad000d08862a65747dba58d1d0b8448692fb3e5e1f9622713bd093dcb21
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_98C292A7_C21E_4D5A_B22F_BBBF6202FDC5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫In that moment, the phenakis wheel became a precious treasure to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫그 말을 들은 순간부터 ⟪k:5⟫페나키 장난감은 ⟪k:6⟫제 안에서 소중한 보물이 "
"되었어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_93B41298_3DF4_48A0_8D07_D1426C701A97
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c0f3350786ce8d5603b2fdf7be25e420115bd133bb31375a8c0981334c6a07a
#. default-sha256: 16575752500504fdb024d5e545697a4c64d376cc99afb4c8d036e3c1919b30ea
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_93B41298_3DF4_48A0_8D07_D1426C701A97"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫We had only just married days earlier..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫왜냐하면――,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그 분과 제가 결혼한 건 ⟪k:3⟫그 당시에는 얼마 전 일이었는데……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_AC30B3DE_B94F_4D8D_8073_E6BBF6BCDEC7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eac002addfc78792ec75e53029850376f58be04c1f913cab73d034577526dd12
#. default-sha256: def6ff7f811df28f6f12b7476ce1886f33ef670f8a93eff05ea6c5488956eb74
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_AC30B3DE_B94F_4D8D_8073_E6BBF6BCDEC7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and yet, he had commissioned it for me without even knowing what I looked like."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 분은 ⟪k:1⟫얼굴도 모르는 저를 위해 ⟪k:2⟫페나키 장난감을 준비해 주신 거였거든요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B2CFF835_E5E2_4264_878F_C5386AD90A33
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 735a46ec0b114f7a76fd2242b19a7a8f1571c963266b605dc22367d42e5c9a8a
#. default-sha256: 9bb5291951718cbe52364c2baf91b08fea82ee0efc4cb8e2fdc7433aa210d4cb
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B2CFF835_E5E2_4264_878F_C5386AD90A33"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was filled with a warm, pleasant elation."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫제 가슴 속에는 ⟪k:1⟫달콤한 행복이 일었어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C3ADD382_6DBA_4008_BD2C_085E5349AA46
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 97cc7c47488663bcbfdf101a65458455a00b79b988e0c2da7ac4a96757f4916f
#. default-sha256: ee34210fc14665eb74caaec19c2a3a5d22493a9b1dff327c4a1e9a55af20c409
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C3ADD382_6DBA_4008_BD2C_085E5349AA46"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I agreed with the owner—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Jacopo was not a ⟪k:3⟫bad⟪k:4⟫ man.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫He merely had "
"difficulty expressing himself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫제 생각도 ⟪k:1⟫주인장 분과 같아요. ⟪k:2⟫그 분은 결코 ⟪k:3⟫몹쓸 사람이 아니에요. ⟪k:4⟫표현을 "
"⟪k:5⟫조금 못 하실 뿐이죠."

#: scenario3:scenario3_9391D42B_4DFD_4122_80A1_D807F73929C4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2f0988033535c50afada15198dd916a9a6e731633aaf2e36baec338a9bb5166e
#. default-sha256: 423d0e842dadc5c98e681b284343fc269b5f51a37604998da3de4d585d366bd6
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9391D42B_4DFD_4122_80A1_D807F73929C4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hurrying back to the carriage, I gave him my deepest thanks."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫서둘러 마차로 돌아온 저는 ⟪k:1⟫그 분께 감사를 드렸어요.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫진심으로 ⟪k:4⟫고마운 마음을 "
"담아서요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_7060EA44_6486_431E_9BE5_104C6DD809B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3aee966a267cea5d11d828b86e839dcac691e4fe252e25a359f8a4ebc9ac1e7d
#. default-sha256: 7f7d1a53803890f0f23035c2cd9645c68883d07f480130986282349a76ca6552
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7060EA44_6486_431E_9BE5_104C6DD809B2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He glanced over at me for a moment, then turned back toward the window and muttered, “yeah.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 분은 저를 힐끗 보신 후, ⟪k:1⟫창밖을 보며 「됐어」란 말씀을 하셨어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_BA2FD31B_CE8C_495A_A583_F8AD51B1CBFB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7685a3b12cb4c6dbd549d9fdf8086012b6c5f75b944292e3cb3e185034edec17
#. default-sha256: 9dc26b3397c8e787fc24e9ac7c947e84212019aaf9717f969e03a6cc0c565302
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_BA2FD31B_CE8C_495A_A583_F8AD51B1CBFB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫From there, we went to a restaurant for dinner."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그 후 ⟪k:2⟫저희는 레스토랑에서 저녁 식사를 했어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_20E7C46F_CC16_486C_AA4B_BC363AF22D4A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d1de5f23cda29f1fe994d130d6747665b303f4a837a9c8a939cbf8851bc9a1d
#. default-sha256: 8a86e10044ee9cbd4268001db5a223241e99a9d4785a4175029a2bb59a2aec6f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_20E7C46F_CC16_486C_AA4B_BC363AF22D4A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“You call this a pizza?! The crust is an atrocity!⟪k:1⟫It’s like I’m chewing on rubber!”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫「이 피자 뭐야! ⟪k:1⟫반죽이 개떡이잖아, ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫고무로 된 빵을 먹는 것 같아!」――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_0B1A017E_BF75_47D5_9F39_564F09E39F3A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f066396d083198d15ff749610950910d3143996ac85f7728d7032ebd4790b750
#. default-sha256: 32a4849ac5e41425bb938a804c0bed4c53c0bde2579597b54c441eca7fde760d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0B1A017E_BF75_47D5_9F39_564F09E39F3A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“How can you wave my country’s flag and not serve spaghetti?!⟪k:1⟫Do you have any shame at "
"all?!”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫「스파게티가 없단 게 무슨 망발이야! ⟪k:1⟫이러고 내 조국 국기를 걸다니, ⟪k:2⟫아주 철면피가 따"
"로 없군」――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_8F1C7A66_6E7B_4A53_A69B_27AE66AFAE91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 66f1fb1ead21df6778f8e07343506bba61e52e687b29d17cfea68acc9bcff77e
#. default-sha256: 60c4cdb3a8f8f70c4405b9ae6b5f88b21ad496f545ddbeb4469f9f2f31546a82
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8F1C7A66_6E7B_4A53_A69B_27AE66AFAE91"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“This wine is pitifully unbalanced! Far too high levels of acidity.⟪k:1⟫Listen to me "
"carefully—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫the house wine is the face of a restaurant.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫「이 와인 뭐야! ⟪k:1⟫산미의 밸런스가 개차반이잖아.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ 잘 들어라, ⟪k:4⟫하우스 와인이란 "
"가게의 얼굴이야」 등등."

#: scenario3:scenario3_E545B29B_B96E_4188_A1EE_6F72C0084E70
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 627dc129cf2f03f420b588e4e03308dda68366d6587264b36e3d9116c52d8aec
#. default-sha256: b576e1659af351569907c32b7c565ab4205f9aa518abfa7fdb558d9108b1b940
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E545B29B_B96E_4188_A1EE_6F72C0084E70"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He complained about every little thing.⟪k:1⟫It was a complete disaster."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 분은 사사건건 클레임을 넣으셔서 ⟪k:1⟫정말 ⟪k:2⟫정신이 없었어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A254ECAD_7658_450A_92BC_2199D6436909
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 53267b988b2731478c70e7ae617df364c24e96ff66e8cab986e268d07ebb924d
#. default-sha256: 07a98fd7f3e28a58f739067cb1689a67d073f94b3fdc3aa2c88baf0a206741cf
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A254ECAD_7658_450A_92BC_2199D6436909"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But curiously enough, I was not at all put off by his behavior."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그래도 ⟪k:1⟫신기하더라고요.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫저는 ⟪k:4⟫그 분의 그런 태도가 ⟪k:5⟫보기 싫지 않았어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_37341C46_68D0_414F_BD92_A328C2B42AEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d8458a63f6b2348e6796fa72ebdec8fdf82c018c2b3c9e5c9e7f3d93e1a30478
#. default-sha256: 04896d968e40ebe408b8bff01c3a435a54e5a4a53a502cb2ef6729c333163056
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_37341C46_68D0_414F_BD92_A328C2B42AEB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫When the sun set, the carriage made its way to a nearby hill."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫해가 완전히 저물자, ⟪k:1⟫마차는 언덕 쪽으로 이동했어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_CBFD4E31_60FE_4758_A625_B5ADCFDA86A1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9d7307e4f4af5b0938cdb26842e88eedb66782ab030b874e91fc52a7114ae61
#. default-sha256: a6a3cab2fb3c63d5eb6d65afec0ca73285c4ceb2d8e7ae6ac97401fc610c849a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CBFD4E31_60FE_4758_A625_B5ADCFDA86A1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The cool nighttime breeze felt wonderful on my skin, flushed from the alcohol, and the light "
"from the gas lamps had a comforting warmth to it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫살짝 취하여 달아오른 살갗에는 ⟪k:1⟫밤바람이 몹시 시원하게 느껴졌고, ⟪k:2⟫가스등 불빛도 따스했"
"어요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_F62BFFF2_3194_4D9C_A208_7AC7635AAB0C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1a7aa8863a2b7fc1a0b9fdefbfa05f5bcc547bbf9d151dd6e570c9e49f619699
#. default-sha256: a491078dae34b0cdc867e1f8e61f64873ddb0421846bb4dac826b362f7254be0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F62BFFF2_3194_4D9C_A208_7AC7635AAB0C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though Jacopo had complained about the quality of the wine, once he had intoxicated himself, "
"his mood improved visibly. ⟪k:1⟫It made him unexpectedly talkative."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그 분도 ⟪k:1⟫와인의 질에 클레임을 넣으셨지만, ⟪k:2⟫취하고 나니 심기가 좋아지신 것 같았어요. "
"⟪k:3⟫놀라울 만큼 ⟪k:4⟫제게 많은 말씀을 하셨거든요."

#: scenario3:scenario3_4BB2CF95_DFA5_4CAB_BBA6_69281459B5AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7070d9b031d1bc14612a097c5c1c594837c422c950b80217d8bc65f8e0bf7c4c
#. default-sha256: c2795cd364665409fb5690a3b5cc8de1a7094c0fd9a703512202718166c64e4d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4BB2CF95_DFA5_4CAB_BBA6_69281459B5AE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Look out at the city.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫A gloomy town that shuts "
"down at night isn’t suited to expansion or growth. But this city isn’t like that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫이 도시를 ⟪k:8⟫한 번 봐봐. ⟪k:9⟫밤이 되면 조용해지는 음침"
"한 도시는 ⟪k:10⟫발전에 부적합해. ⟪k:11⟫하지만 ⟪k:12⟫이 도시는 안 그렇지."

#: scenario3:scenario3_14472A94_21AB_417A_A65C_D703EBC95D8B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5fc07198250daf9e65defc2297548ed8a0f722e5e132f81f2b875ac39b8c3ac6
#. default-sha256: bb1d3b603c636e2871e9a9641dc2e31089429a7f265fb9783b058658413d4c1b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_14472A94_21AB_417A_A65C_D703EBC95D8B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You can see people walking beneath the lamps,⟪k:1⟫and you can hear the bustle of them "
"talking."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫가스등 밑에 사람이 있고, ⟪k:1⟫북적이는 목소리도 들려……."

#: scenario3:scenario3_709A2976_748E_4697_B6D1_575115A0CB1F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 981009fcc084d8ca7b3912a999f89acb8590e9fb75603c38aa1a379e3fe6f34f
#. default-sha256: cb40f21fe7bfdb20aad1453323fd55aadbbf2fb680c2a538971bd880d74844b3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_709A2976_748E_4697_B6D1_575115A0CB1F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This is a city that still has plenty of room to grow.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫As they ride the rising wave "
"of the economy,⟪k:3⟫many, many more people will gather here."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이 도시는 ⟪k:1⟫더 성장할 거야. ⟪k:2⟫경제의 파도를 타고 ⟪k:3⟫이주민이 더욱 늘어날걸."

#: scenario3:scenario3_299E2B51_7F4E_4F47_8D97_6C4CCC79ACDF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a0fa8572cdc10680f0f8e0634599ca30f8e9e1d58bf7bad5945371e6d3ac90eb
#. default-sha256: 8d991b68742052e80e1a8aaed8303cad80b9e7e7dfdfe48254f7de1529342fb1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_299E2B51_7F4E_4F47_8D97_6C4CCC79ACDF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫More people means more money in circulation.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫More money in circulation means the "
"city grows,⟪k:3⟫companies are founded, and more goods are bought and sold."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫사람이 늘어나면 ⟪k:1⟫금전 순환도 빨라져. ⟪k:2⟫금전 순환이 빨라지면 ⟪k:3⟫도시가 커지고, ⟪k:4⟫"
"회사가 생기고, ⟪k:5⟫물자가 유통돼."

#: scenario3:scenario3_49676B00_307A_485B_A463_06A11753C9AE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 195af96376381ac9eb27f2b0844fd6a4dd9d1650a3c03476429f12d0242f1f7b
#. default-sha256: 8cc1e140552951b1f18fbd814ec5c81d662233f504d3b371fc53a69cd35441b5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_49676B00_307A_485B_A463_06A11753C9AE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Will it really change so drastically?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그렇게 ⟪k:2⟫확 바뀌는 법인가요……?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_4136B471_10CD_4893_A969_986808AAED08
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e7153c33db108ee9bcffdeae49f0c351da4df793098ae7f3a36afcacd86e096
#. default-sha256: d1bafa92c2f927857e40aacb2c76ff29c9ae589ee7cf489284866d2e8a4c4ad9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_4136B471_10CD_4893_A969_986808AAED08"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It can be difficult to see what’s happening from the inside.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The majority of "
"people just go about their daily lives,⟪k:4⟫and the next thing they know, things are different."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫변화하는 과정이란 ⟪k:2⟫알아보기 힘든 법이야.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫많은 인간이 생각 없이 사는 동안, "
"⟪k:5⟫세계가 바뀌는 거지."

#: scenario3:scenario3_39734B13_3D4C_4B9B_A507_3A350D7C0483
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8f89d940bf0b004d080fa3363f44742c7fad1f68d42184818630cff074b9d291
