msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Only those with eyes sharp enough to realize what’s happening can seize success. ⟪k:2⟫I "
"cannot afford to overlook even the most minute change."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫빠르게 알아채는 놈만이 ⟪k:2⟫성공을 거머쥐어.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫……그렇기에 ⟪k:5⟫눈을 뗄 수가 없지."

#: scenario3:scenario3_C29F2513_568B_450D_B77C_A53EDD33F045
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ecf1e9f7dc5c127aee84f21f291d57aaaa890b745669d5a6b91a80b740d7897a
