msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫As a whole, the country is on the poor side,⟪k:2⟫and if nobody does anything about "
"that..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫나라 전체로 치면 ⟪k:2⟫가난한 축에 들 거야. ⟪k:3⟫이대로 가면 틀림없이………."

#: scenario3:scenario3_8B2AA0A1_F2AE_4C56_91F8_D740CF672B9E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 552b84388f62fbfd76736eb26d737b633b37b75f2ea3df61ce1c323283419c18
