msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...Well, I’ll have to remember not to get myself drunk around a woman again. ⟪k:2⟫"
"Forget everything I just said.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫It’s about time we head back to the house."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫나 원, ⟪k:2⟫여자 앞에서 취하면 못 쓰겠군. ⟪k:3⟫방금 한 말은 잊어 줘.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫시간도 늦"
"었으니 ⟪k:6⟫저택으로 돌아가자."

